<title>SINGAPORE: Thai refiner Rayong tenders to sell Apr gasoline.</title>
<headline>Thai refiner Rayong tenders to sell Apr gasoline.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai refiner Rayong Refinery Co Ltd has tendered to sell around 230,000 barrels of 95-octane unleaded gasoline lifting April 17, industry sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender closes April 8 and is valid for the same day.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
</text>
